- content_for :title, "Desk Book"
- github_url = "https://github.com/Egor1007-del/desk_book"

.container.py-4.py-lg-5
  section.home-hero.rounded-4.p-4.p-lg-5.mb-4
    .row.align-items-center.g-5
      .col-lg-7
        p.home-kicker.mb-3 People, roles, continuity
        h1.display-5.fw-bold.mb-3
          | A directory that remembers the people behind the work.
        p.lead.text-secondary.mb-4
          | Desk Book keeps employee contacts, positions and responsibilities in one clear place,
          |  so the right colleague is never more than a few clicks away.
        .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2
          - if policy([:admin, User]).index?
            = link_to "Manage employees", admin_users_path, class: "btn btn-dark btn-lg"
          - else
            = link_to "Open directory", users_path, class: "btn btn-dark btn-lg"
          = link_to "Edit profile", edit_profile_path, class: "btn btn-outline-dark btn-lg"
          = link_to github_url, class: "btn btn-link text-dark",
            target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" do
            | View on GitHub
      .col-lg-5
        .home-summary.rounded-4.p-4
          p.text-uppercase.small.fw-semibold.text-secondary.mb-3 Current desk note
          p.fs-4.fw-semibold.mb-3 = current_user.full_name
          p.display-4.fw-bold.mb-3 = pluralize(@employees_count, "employee")
          p.text-secondary.mb-0
            | Reliable directories are quiet infrastructure: they save a little time every day,
            |  then save a great deal when someone urgently needs the right person.

  .row.g-4
    .col-lg-5
      .card.border-0.shadow-sm.h-100
        .card-body.p-4
          p.home-kicker.mb-2 The desk-book parable
          blockquote.mb-0
            p.fs-5.mb-3
              | A team once labelled every key but forgot to write down which door it opened.
              |  The labels were perfect; the work still stopped.
            footer.text-secondary
              | A useful directory connects information to a real person and a real responsibility.
    .col-lg-7
      .accordion.shadow-sm#directory-guide
        .accordion-item
          h2.accordion-header
            button.accordion-button(
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#directory-purpose"
              aria-expanded="true"
              aria-controls="directory-purpose"
            )
              | What does Desk Book solve?
          #directory-purpose.accordion-collapse.collapse.show[data-bs-parent="#directory-guide"]
            .accordion-body
              | It turns scattered contact details into one searchable register with a clear position,
              |  phone number and email for every employee.
        .accordion-item
          h2.accordion-header
            button.accordion-button.collapsed(
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#directory-access"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="directory-access"
            )
              | How is access kept clear?
          #directory-access.accordion-collapse.collapse[data-bs-parent="#directory-guide"]
            .accordion-body
              | Employees can browse the directory and maintain their own account. Administrators manage
              |  employee records, roles and organization analytics.
        .accordion-item
          h2.accordion-header
            button.accordion-button.collapsed(
              type="button"
              data-bs-toggle="collapse"
              data-bs-target="#directory-habit"
              aria-expanded="false"
              aria-controls="directory-habit"
            )
              | What makes a directory useful?
          #directory-habit.accordion-collapse.collapse[data-bs-parent="#directory-guide"]
            .accordion-body
              | Small updates. A current phone number today prevents a long search tomorrow.
